    {
      "id": "mean-zero-sobolev-poincare-inequality",
      "type": "exercise",
      "regions": [
        [
          236,
          80,
          580,
          955,
          875
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Assume that $\\Omega$ is bounded, connected, and has the $1$-extension property. Let\\[V=\\left\\{u\\in H^1(\\Omega)\\ \\middle|\\ \\int_{\\Omega}u(\\bm{x})\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}=0\\right\\}.\\]Show that there is a constant $C$ such that\\[\\int_{\\Omega}|u(\\bm{x})|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\leq C\\int_{\\Omega}|\\nabla u(\\bm{x})|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\quad\\text{for all }u\\in V.\\]For what other subsets $V$ of $H^1(\\Omega)$ will such an inequality hold?",
      "zh": "假设 $\\Omega$ 有界, 连通且具有 $1$ 阶延拓性质. 令\\[V=\\left\\{u\\in H^1(\\Omega)\\ \\middle|\\ \\int_{\\Omega}u(\\bm{x})\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}=0\\right\\}.\\]证明存在常数 $C$, 使\\[\\int_{\\Omega}|u(\\bm{x})|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\leq C\\int_{\\Omega}|\\nabla u(\\bm{x})|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\quad\\text{for all }u\\in V.\\]对 $H^1(\\Omega)$ 的哪些其他子集 $V$, 也有这样的不等式成立?",
      "label": "ex:mean-zero-sobolev-poincare-inequality",
      "render_role": "exercise",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 236,
